WEBVTT

00:11:28.642 --> 00:11:30.060
It’s unique to my culture,

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:32.020
and it means something real to me.

00:11:33.355 --> 00:11:34.773
I twerk because I’m talented.

00:11:36.525 --> 00:11:39.778
(Applause and cheers)

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:43.073
Because I’m sexual,
but not to be sexualized.

00:11:44.408 --> 00:11:46.702
(Applause)

00:11:46.702 --> 00:11:48.162
I twerk to own my power,

00:11:48.162 --> 00:11:49.621
to reclaim my Blackness,

00:11:49.621 --> 00:11:51.415
my culture.

00:11:51.707 --> 00:11:53.250
I twerk for fat Black women,

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.044
because being fat and Black
is a beautiful thing.

00:11:56.503 --> 00:11:59.673
(Applause and cheers)